{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10126050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10126050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1012605001:1":{"text":"阿爸，这些大哥哥大姐姐是谁？","source_cn":"阿爸，这些大哥哥大姐姐是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE092794B11DB9B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012605002:1":{"text":"来，孩子，我们一起感谢这些林隐村的恩人，是他们清理了魔物。","source_cn":"来，孩子，我们一起感谢这些林隐村的恩人，是他们清理了魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C99B03DA4C18B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012605003:1":{"text":"谢谢大哥哥大姐姐们！林隐村给你们添麻烦了！","source_cn":"谢谢大哥哥大姐姐们！林隐村给你们添麻烦了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6D9F709EDE9A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012605004:1":{"text":"这是我们的职责，事后要感谢就谢梅林吧。\n布莱恩，刚才你有在洞里察觉到其他人吗？","source_cn":"这是我们的职责，事后要感谢就谢梅林吧。\\n布莱恩，刚才...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x203701A814AA43AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"这是我们的职责，事后要感谢就谢梅林吧。\n布莱恩，刚才你有在洞里察觉到其他人吗？","female":"这是我们的职责，事后要感谢就谢梅林吧。\n布莱恩，刚才你有在洞里察觉到其他人吗？","variant_male_record_index":"110330","variant_female_record_index":"110331","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012605005:1":{"text":"有，那些人都很害怕，为了不惊动他们我没有声张。","source_cn":"有，那些人都很害怕，为了不惊动他们我没有声张。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2754AD891F22FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012605006:1":{"text":"孩子，和你一起逃出来的村民都在这里吗？","source_cn":"孩子，和你一起逃出来的村民都在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05162FA681EB0D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012605007:1":{"text":"是的！有人受伤了，我是为了找药草才出来的！","source_cn":"是的！有人受伤了，我是为了找药草才出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DBD16B277A2686E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012605008:1":{"text":"我们看到了他刚才的无畏，你有个勇敢的儿子，伊凡。","source_cn":"我们看到了他刚才的无畏，你有个勇敢的儿子，伊凡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E4B1C116622EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012605009:1":{"text":"是啊，这孩子将来一定会成为个好村长，至少比我要称职……","source_cn":"是啊，这孩子将来一定会成为个好村长，至少比我要称职……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9C8D626D502472B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012605010:1":{"text":"带我们去找其他村民吧，药草的事我们一起想办法。","source_cn":"带我们去找其他村民吧，药草的事我们一起想办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ADDC6A1892D84EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d